	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=851,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050100"},
		line=851,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The sky is aflutter with frozen flakes of black snow.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Ah, I remember this place...",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Since I started treating Soujin-sama, I have come upon this landscape twice already.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The first time, I was struck speechless by how beautiful it was.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"But even then, I knew that this is the world Isuzu always warned me about, the realm where priestesses dare not tread.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"All who find themselves here eventually perish, their souls frozen beneath the black snow.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How did I escape those times before?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I raise my body up slightly, taking in my surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"All that greets me are lone and level drifts of black snow, stretching far into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"I have to return to the real world.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"But my body refuses to obey.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Even as I desperately try to stand, the black snow continues to pile up on my body.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“So cold...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"So incredibly cold...",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The indescribable chill slowly seeps into my core.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Freezing over my frail heart.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"More than even the piercing cold, the numb apathy seizing my chest saps my will to resist.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Is this it... for me?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Soujin-sama, were you at least able to regain your powers?",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"If so, then even the life of this unqualified, immature Exalt-Priestess had meaning.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Soujin-sama...",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Did I make myself worthy of being your bride?",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"I rush back to my room and lie down at once.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Laying beside me is the unconscious Kotone, and Isuzu is kneeling at my bedside.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-sama, are you prepared?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. We have no time to waste.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, bring Kotone back.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Isuzu places her hand above my head.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Her quiet invocation fills my ears, and I'm assailed by an overwhelming drowsiness.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Wait for me, Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"I'm coming... for you...",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"I slowly blink my eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"And find myself standing upon a vast landscape, barren of all color.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Black snow flutters down from the sky above.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Piling up in endless drifts extending as far as the eye can see.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is this place?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Suddenly, I recall the words of the Inou Tooru in my dream.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"He whispered of the black snow piling up right as he met his end.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Pitch-black snow is a sight unknown to our world.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Perhaps he was looking upon the same vista that I am now.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I scan my surroundings once again.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Nothing, save for the endless drifts of black snow.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Even the sounds of my footsteps are drowned out by the deathly stillness of this landscape.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"This incomparably desolate, indescribably beautiful landscape devoid of a single other soul.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hmm...?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Looking closer, there are round shapes here and there standing out among the snowdrifts.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Shapes that resemble burial mounds.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"As I brush it aside, pitch-black snow gives way to chalk-white skin.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"─The pale face of a priestess.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Lying here in eternal slumber is a priestess I've never met before.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"My eyes fall upon the countless other mounds scattered across the landscape.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Are these all the corpses of priestesses?",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"The blood in my veins freezes over.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I have to find her.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone! Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"I rush from mound to mound, hastily brushing away the snow atop each one.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Answer me, Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Each time, I'm met with the bloodless visage of another priestess.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Many of them just young girls, not even of age.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone! Where are you?!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"I lift my gaze and stare helplessly into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The mounds stretch on and on into the horizon.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The souls of countless priestesses are interred here.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"They number in the thousands, the tens of thousands...",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Calm down. Searching at random won't get me anywhere.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"That's right...",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I was able to arrive here by following the thread binding our souls together.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"That thread should still be connecting us, even now.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"I close my eyes and think of Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"With all my will, I banish my intrusive thoughts and attune my consciousness to the link between us.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Over there!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"A gleaming strand of gold appears before me, stretching into the darkness.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"If I follow this, I should be able to find Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I chase after the thread until I arrive at a mound.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"This one is shallower than the others, and I can still see a familiar face peeking out from beneath the snow.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone...!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nm, nnnh...”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Kotone lets out only the tiniest of breaths.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"I lift her up, cradling her to my chest.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kotone! Wake up!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Her body is frightfully cold and unresponsive.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin... sama...?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"She slowly flutters her eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, it's me. Tokita Soujin. I'm here for you.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... What are you doing here...?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I followed the thread connecting our souls.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh... What have... I done...?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We can talk later. Let's get out of here first.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I no longer have the strength required to return to our world.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I can hardly even... maintain my consciousness...”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"The strength starts to drain from her body.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If I die... our connection will keep you tethered to this place...”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall sever it... so please, return to our world... while you still can...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"Kotone shows me a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"We warriors proudly face our fates with a resolved grimace, but even in death, Kotone will still be wearing that incomparably kindly smile of hers.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Such is the benevolence of a priestess... No, of this girl Shiinoha Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I remember you telling me how sensitive to the cold you were.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's no way I'd leave you behind in a place like this.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You freely offered me all of your devotion.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No man could ever want for a finer bride.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And I refuse to be the sort of coward who'd abandon his betrothed!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You finally... called me your...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Kotone's eyes glisten with the limpid proof of her devotion.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Unfortunately... I have already expended the last of my power...”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There is nothing left I can do to be of service to...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I unsheathe my blade and draw it across the inside of my arm.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then you can have your power back.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I hold my arm above the motionless Kotone, dripping my blood into her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I don't know if this will return her magicks to her.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"But this is the best a boorish warrior such as I can come up with.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Nnm... *gulp...*”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"As Kotone exhales, the color returns to her face.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"The unremitting snow continues to fall, but it disappears now before it touches her.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Her body heat is returning─",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This is more than I deserve...”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm just returning what I didn't need.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Kotone reaches up, taking my hand in her own.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"The comforting heat of her body seeps into my palm.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“How mysterious this is...”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Just a few moments ago, it felt as though my heart was about to freeze over, but now...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But now, it is as though the sun itself is filling up my chest.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Kotone shows me that familiar smile of hers.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"A warm and radiant smile, one that banishes all the chill from my own body.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can you make it back?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But of course, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"She replies, squeezing my hand tight.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Isuzu comes out of Kotone's room.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"She's been watching over her ever since she regained consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How's she doing?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You may rest easy. She is simply sleeping off her fatigue.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“She should be back on her feet within just a few days.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We have Tokita-sama to thank for managing to bring her back.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Isuzu lowers her head to me.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, what did you do while you were asleep?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I am keenly interested as well. This would be very helpful for future reference.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I tell the two of them about the world of endless black snow.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Black snow? That sounds like a fairy tale.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“No, it is most certainly not a fairy tale.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Isuzu murmurs, her expression clouding over.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“The world of black snow is the preordained destination that awaits all priestesses.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We know of that place as Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Isuzu directs us to the main hall to explain in greater detail.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“The knowledge I am about to share is ordinarily reserved for only priestesses of the highest rank.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I ask that you hold it in confidence.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Akari and I silently nod.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“At their core, magicks are miracles wrought by the gift of\nOomikami's divine power.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“But from another perspective, one could say that magicks exploit Oomikami's power to distort the karmic fabric of our world.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It is a most useful power, but karmic causality cannot be rewritten without consequence.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Tampering with our world's karmic order necessarily results in 'karmic distortions' that exert adverse influences elsewhere.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Put simply, a boon to one must be accompanied by a bane to another.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So basically, everything has to balance out in the end?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Indeed. We priestesses call this the Law of Karmic Antinomy.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Additionally, we refer to the adverse effects brought about by karmic distortions as 'retributions.'”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Isuzu tells us all this in her soft-spoken voice.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Does that mean if Kotone Heals me with her magicks, someone else will be injured by this retribution?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"If so, I'd never be able to forgive myself.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You needn't worry about that.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We have mechanisms in place which prevent retributions from causing harm.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It is said that priestesses of old always prepared\n'simulacra,' which were vessels intended to receive the retribution of their magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It was forbidden to use magicks without having such a karmic receptacle ready in advance.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“However, preparing an appropriate simulacrum every time one intended to use magicks proved terribly troublesome.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“And moreover, powerful magicks demanded comparably large simulacra...”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Grand rituals would dry up whole lakes, or denude entire mountainsides, for example.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“That was why the Founding Empress remade our system of magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“She eliminated the adverse effects of karmic distortions by banishing all retributions to another world.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“As you may have surmised, that other world is Ne no Kuni...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“A world where karmic distortions fall as black snow.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"She turned an entire other world into a receptacle for the consequences of our magicks...",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"I think back to the world of Ne no Kuni.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"The endless drifts of black snow, stretching as far as the eye could see.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"The profound, all-consuming stillness of that frozen landscape.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"A world awash with tragedy and beauty.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"What might have once been, before the ceaseless deluge of karmic distortions remade all in its image?",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did anyone use to live in Ne no Kuni?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, such records are lost to us.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“But it is said that Ne no Kuni was inhabited by a god other than Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Makes you feel sorry for the poor guy.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"Akari knits her eyebrows.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“In exchange, however, priestesses became able to perform great feats of magicks without need to worry about the ensuing retribution.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“The existence of powerful Artifacts like the Barrier and Inner Iseya's defenses is all owed to the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like Himi-no-Mikoto was every bit as influential when it came to the world of magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It would be no exaggeration to say that she ushered in a new era.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Indeed, we now classify all magicks that make use of a dedicated simulacrum as 'ancient magicks.'”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“And prior even to ancient magicks, there existed a form of arcanery known as 'primeval magicks,' but I digress.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"At any rate, it's safe to say that with Himi-no-Mikoto's birth, the world was never the same.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Be it politics or magicks, the institutions she created still form the basis of the Empire as we know it.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Truly, all of us could be said to be Himi-no-Mikoto's children.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, backing up a bit, why was Kotone lying there in Ne no Kuni?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We use our own bodies as a conduit to channel karmic distortions to Ne no Kuni.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“However, doing so afflicts our souls, until unable to resist any longer, we succumb to Ne no Kuni's grasp.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“There is a saying among priestesses that none who have seen black snow are long for this world.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh no...”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Akari and I share a troubled look.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Does that mean Kotone is already...",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Fortunately, Tokita-sama was able to rescue her this time, but there is no telling what will happen next time.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What can we do?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It is paramount that she not use any more magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“But I know all too well that such a prohibition amounts to nothing short of denying her very purpose as a priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Just as you will surely fight to your last, Tokita-sama, I believe Her Eminence will also insist on expending the last of her magicks in service to you.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I get how she feels, but still...”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“If I may express my own selfish desire, all I wish is for Her Eminence... for my dear friend Kotone to live as long as she can.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I feel the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, Tokita-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Isuzu turns to face us head-on.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I ask this knowing better than anyone just how important the duties of the Exalt-Priestess are...”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“But please, if you truly care for her well-being, I humbly beseech your forbearance in ensuring that she uses her magicks as little as possible.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"With a trembling voice, the superintendent of Iseya prostrates herself at our feet.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
